    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present Whitehall, Parteen.\r\n\r\nThis large property is just 3km from Limerick City and boasts a large private garden to the front and rear.\r\n\r\nWhile this property is in need of decorative renovations, its potential is unmatched in the market.\r\n\r\nThe bathrooms have been recently upgraded to modern standards and we have been informed that the property qualifies for the Vacant Homes Grant.\r\n\r\nIncluded in the sale are kitchen appliances, light fittings and flooring. \r\n\r\nBuilt in 1960"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen - 4.32m x 2.53m\r\nFully Fitted kitchen with excellent storage space and access to the rear\r\n\r\nUtility - 2.95m x 0.90m\r\nPlumbed and access to rear.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.34m x 3.53m\r\nTimber flooring with an open fireplace and access to the sunroom\r\n\r\nSunroom - 6.46m x 3.84m\r\nBright triple aspect sunroom with tiled flooring and access to the rear.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.31m x 2.51m\r\nSouth Facing with dark timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.40m x 3.06m\r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.68m x 3.36m\r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring and en-suite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.68m x 2.74m\r\nSingle bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.64m x 2.20m\r\nJet powered jacuzzi , W.C. and H.W.B.\r\n\r\nSecond Floor - 6.00m x 4.20m\r\nLarge open plan bedroom with timber floors and a ridge height of 2m."
      },
      {
